---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { APPLY_URL, COHORT, QUIZ_PAGE } from '../site';

const arrow = '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>';

const stats = [
  ['20+ years', 'In ministry'],
  ['2019', 'Became an online prophetic coach'],
  ['1,000+', 'Women served'],
];

const chapters = [
  {
    when: '2017 to 2019',
    title: 'Called as a Prophet, Sent Into the Online Space',
    body: [
      'I knew from a young age that the Lord had called me as a prophet, but I didn’t receive who I was until 2017. Two years later, He led me online as a prophetic coach, something I had never seen anyone else do before. It was the first time I publicly announced myself as a prophet, and things began to shift swiftly.',
      'I had no idea what an “online prophetic coach” was even supposed to look like. So I did what I had always done in my office: gave counsel and strategy for the future. I launched in headfirst, and I found an audience that was untapped and untouched.',
    ],
  },
  {
    when: 'Years one to three',
    title: 'The Gift Was Real. The Income Was Not.',
    body: [
      'For my first two years online, I made nothing. By year three, women began sowing into me. I never asked for offerings. The transformation was simply so real that they wanted to give.',
      'It unsettled me, because I didn’t know exactly what they were paying for. So I named it. I wrote down what I was doing and the results these women were getting, and I shaped it into my first coaching container: The Leah Complex, five weeks for forty dollars.',
      'I wrote the workbooks, built the landing page, and delivered everything myself, having never been tech-savvy a day in my life. The gift was carrying me. It wasn’t yet a business.',
    ],
  },
  {
    when: 'Year four',
    title: 'A Price on My Work, but No Foundation',
    body: [
      'I invested hundreds of dollars in trainings and thousands in other people’s expertise so I could serve the women I’m called to. I developed my own methodology and came to know the woman God kept sending me.',
      'By year four, I had put a price on my work, and I was earning $500 to $1,200 a month at best. Not enough to live on.',
    ],
  },
  {
    when: 'The turning point',
    title: 'Building From Identity and Purpose',
    body: [
      'Then something in me shifted. I stepped out on faith and launched an offer beyond anything I had priced before: a cohort for women ready not only to walk in their gift, but to lay a foundation and build a coaching business on it.',
      'My first five clients enrolled. As they walked through the process and trusted me to guide them, they began making sales and creating income of their own.',
    ],
  },
  {
    when: 'Today',
    title: 'How I Grew My Monthly Income 5X by Building From Purpose and Identity',
    body: [
      'My identity and my purpose are the foundation of my money-making strategy. With my flagship offer and my lead-generation offers, I have sustained five times my monthly income for two full years.',
      'Not because I worked harder, but because I stopped relying on my gift alone and started building from purpose and identity. I could see exactly what women needed, and I had a method to bring them to their next level.',
    ],
  },
];
---
<Base
  title="About Naomi Shaffer, Prophet and Marketplace Strategist | Kingdom Roe"
  description="From prophetic coach in 2019 to 5X income growth: Naomi Shaffer's story and The Called Method™ behind Kingdom Roe Coaching & Consulting."
>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="eyebrow">My story</p>
        <h1>How I Started a Christian Coaching Business Online After Years in Ministry</h1>
        <hr class="rule" />
        <p class="lede">I’m Naomi Shaffer, Prophet and Marketplace Strategist. I help professional Christian women turn what they know into coaching businesses that attract clients and generate income.</p>
        <dl class="stats">
          {stats.map(([n, l]) => <div><dt>{n}</dt><dd>{l}</dd></div>)}
        </dl>
      </div>
      <div class="portrait">
        <img src="/images/naomi-green.jpg" alt="Prophet Naomi Shaffer in a green top and black pants" width="872" height="1552" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band white">
    <div class="wrap story">
      {chapters.map((c) => (
        <article class="chapter">
          <p class="eyebrow">{c.when}</p>
          <h2>{c.title}</h2>
          {c.body.map((p) => <p>{p}</p>)}
        </article>
      ))}

      <figure class="pull">
        <svg class="quote-mark" viewBox="0 0 48 40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4h14v14c0 9-5 15-13 17l-1-4c5-2 7-6 7-10H4V4zm24 0h14v14c0 9-5 15-13 17l-1-4c5-2 7-6 7-10h-7V4z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
        <blockquote>Your identity and your purpose are the foundation of your money-making.</blockquote>
      </figure>

      <div class="chapter">
        <p>Every faith-based coaching business must be built on a strong, secure foundation. That foundation is your spiritual identity. Your identity reveals the gifts God has given you, and your purpose shows you what you have to offer and who you are called to offer it to.</p>
        <p>You already have the anointing and the expertise. Inside The Called Method™ 6-Month Cohort, you’ll build a flagship offer, along with a content and sales strategy that attracts the right audience, so you can launch into the online space creating both impact and income. One aligned offer can position you to 2X, 3X, even 5X your income.</p>
        <p>I grew up in the church, and I’ve been in ministry since I was 15. When the Lord led me online in 2019, my life was never the same. Bring me what you know and what you carry, and I will help you build on it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band closing-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="closing">
        <span class="mono" aria-hidden="true">NR</span>
        <p class="eyebrow">The Called Method™</p>
        <h2>Build on a Strong, Secure Foundation</h2>
        <p class="lede">{COHORT.name} begins {COHORT.begins}. Registration closes {COHORT.registrationCloses.replace(', 2027', '')}.</p>
        <div class="cta-pair"><a class="btn" href={APPLY_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apply to work with me <Fragment set:html={arrow} /></a><a class="text-link alt-link" href={QUIZ_PAGE}>Not ready to apply? Take my mini quiz <Fragment set:html={arrow} /></a></div>
        <p class="fine">Results vary based on individual effort and circumstances.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-hero { padding-block: 88px 100px; }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: center; }
  .stack { display: grid; gap: 18px; min-width: 0; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 4.8vw, 54px); }
  .stats { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px 56px; margin: 18px 0 0; }
  .stats dt { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 36px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.1; }
  .stats dd { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); }
  .portrait { position: relative; max-width: 420px; justify-self: end; width: 100%; }
  .portrait::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 72px -40px -40px 72px; background: var(--tan); border-radius: 24px; }
  .portrait img { position: relative; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 24px; }

  .story { max-width: 780px; display: grid; gap: 72px; }
  .chapter { display: grid; gap: 18px; }
  .chapter h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 36px); font-weight: 500; }
  .pull { margin: 0; padding-block: 40px 56px; border-top: 3px solid var(--pink-line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pink-line); display: grid; gap: 20px; }
  .quote-mark { width: 40px; height: 34px; color: var(--pink); }
  .pull blockquote { margin: 0; font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 38px); line-height: 1.3; color: var(--ink); max-width: 620px; }

  .closing-band { padding-bottom: 160px; }
  .closing { position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: var(--white); border-radius: var(--radius); border-top: 6px solid var(--pink); box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(40, 15, 10, .06); padding: 72px 32px; text-align: center; display: grid; gap: 20px; justify-items: center; }
  .closing h2 { font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 44px); position: relative; }
  .closing .lede { max-width: 600px; position: relative; }
  .closing .eyebrow, .closing div, .closing .fine { position: relative; }
  .fine { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  .mono { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: -60px; transform: translateX(-50%); font-family: var(--display); font-size: 300px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pink-faint); line-height: 1; pointer-events: none; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 56px; }
    .portrait { justify-self: start; width: calc(100% - 40px); max-width: 380px; }
    .closing-band { padding-bottom: 96px; }
    .mono { font-size: 220px; }
    .closing { padding: 64px 22px; }
    .closing .btn { padding: 17px 28px; white-space: nowrap; }
  }
</style>
